(556913, 57051, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, based on a classical design. Be very careful of unwanted items in the frame. To the middle left and right, you''ve left some things that shouldn''t be there. Under the ''advanced editing'' rules, you''re allowed to clone them out, and to correct unwanted highlights. 4</td>', 'Nice idea, based on a classical design. Be very careful of unwanted items in the frame. To the middle left and right, you''ve left some things that shouldn''t be there. Under the ''advanced editing'' rules, you''re allowed to clone them out, and to correct unwanted highlights. 4', '2004-01-26 00:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(556918, 56761, 9073, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I''m wrong, but I feel that this ''firelight'' cannot fit this challenge as it''s stationary. A nice shot, otherwise. Lovely golden hues. 2</td>', 'Correct me if I''m wrong, but I feel that this ''firelight'' cannot fit this challenge as it''s stationary. A nice shot, otherwise. Lovely golden hues. 2', '2004-01-26 00:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
