(557438, 57033, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work... by far one of the more creative ideas I have seen in this challenge.  I love the idea.  I don''t know if you tried this or not, but it could have been interesting to see what this would have looked like by putting the sparkler in front of your subject instead of behind.  That could have illuminated your subject for a nice effect as well... excellent work :) = 10</td>', 'This is excellent work... by far one of the more creative ideas I have seen in this challenge.  I love the idea.  I don''t know if you tried this or not, but it could have been interesting to see what this would have looked like by putting the sparkler in front of your subject instead of behind.  That could have illuminated your subject for a nice effect as well... excellent work :) = 10', '2004-01-26 08:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(557443, 56807, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work.  I was hoping that some would go the extra mile and work with several different colors of light.  Great shot :) = 10</td>', 'Beautiful work.  I was hoping that some would go the extra mile and work with several different colors of light.  Great shot :) = 10', '2004-01-26 08:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
