(557448, 55912, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea.. your spot editing around the edges of the brush are showing.  One thing you can do to help preven this is to push your highlight levels after you edit.  Subtle mistakes like this one will pop out at you and you can cancel the highlight change and go back and clean up....</td>', 'This is a nice idea.. your spot editing around the edges of the brush are showing.  One thing you can do to help preven this is to push your highlight levels after you edit.  Subtle mistakes like this one will pop out at you and you can cancel the highlight change and go back and clean up....', '2004-01-26 08:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
