(557554, 56933, 255, '<td valign="top">now this is cool. sort of along the lines of something i wanted to do--but of course, didn''t get around to it. :)<br/> <br/>the photographing of glass with colored lights is some of my favorite photography; and this has an art deco/pop art feel to it--very simplistic, yet makes a statement. i love the vivid blue with the splashs of red--even the black shadows are perfect. very cool composition, as well.  great work, and well done. 10.</td>', 'now this is cool. sort of along the lines of something i wanted to do--but of course, didn''t get around to it. :) the photographing of glass with colored lights is some of my favorite photography; and this has an art deco/pop art feel to it--very simplistic, yet makes a statement. i love the vivid blue with the splashs of red--even the black shadows are perfect. very cool composition, as well.  great work, and well done. 10.', '2004-01-26 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
