(557591, 57052, 13381, '<td valign="top">I read a book once that mentioned that if you want to portray the idea that a person likes crossword puzzles (as an example), a more abstract picture of glasses, a pencil, and a crossword puzzle depicts that far better than a portrait of the person doing a crossword puzzle.  That''s a random aside. This image reminds me a lot of that article; the portrait I see is of a parent or grandparent who loves to read to a child.  I like this picture a lot. It''s very poignant, and the composition is well done.</td>', 'I read a book once that mentioned that if you want to portray the idea that a person likes crossword puzzles (as an example), a more abstract picture of glasses, a pencil, and a crossword puzzle depicts that far better than a portrait of the person doing a crossword puzzle.  That''s a random aside. This image reminds me a lot of that article; the portrait I see is of a parent or grandparent who loves to read to a child.  I like this picture a lot. It''s very poignant, and the composition is well done.', '2004-01-26 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
