(557907, 57019, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. A fire in the background may have been perfect!</td>', 'Nice lighting. A fire in the background may have been perfect!', '2004-01-26 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(557908, 56969, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. The subject matter is a bit dull...</td>', 'Nicely lit. The subject matter is a bit dull...', '2004-01-26 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(557910, 57049, 15642, '<td valign="top">Ive seen this image before, but nicely done all the same.</td>', 'Ive seen this image before, but nicely done all the same.', '2004-01-26 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(557911, 57046, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cute and funny.</td>', 'Cute and funny.', '2004-01-26 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(557913, 57033, 15642, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very cool. My only beef: I wish the subject was looking right into lens.</td>', 'Wow. Very cool. My only beef: I wish the subject was looking right into lens.', '2004-01-26 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(557914, 56954, 15642, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautifully lit. Nice job.', '2004-01-26 14:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(557915, 56514, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I''d lose the border.</td>', 'Nice, but I''d lose the border.', '2004-01-26 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(557916, 57037, 15642, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. The color and texture read perfectly.</td>', 'Very, very nice. The color and texture read perfectly.', '2004-01-26 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(557917, 57035, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but sort of flat for me.</td>', 'Nice, but sort of flat for me.', '2004-01-26 14:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(557919, 57052, 7291, '<td valign="top">Impressivev clarity despite the low light set up.</td>', 'Impressivev clarity despite the low light set up.', '2004-01-26 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(557925, 56761, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and textures.</td>', 'Nice lighting and textures.', '2004-01-26 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(557927, 56647, 7291, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the actual halo was intended or not but it''s perfect.  There are some blown out highlights on the chest that could have been taken care of with some dodging but otherwise it''s a fantastic photo.</td>', 'I don''t know if the actual halo was intended or not but it''s perfect.  There are some blown out highlights on the chest that could have been taken care of with some dodging but otherwise it''s a fantastic photo.', '2004-01-26 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(557928, 55933, 7291, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I might have preferred a thiner border but that''s just my taste. - 10</td>', 'Awesome!  I might have preferred a thiner border but that''s just my taste. - 10', '2004-01-26 14:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(557930, 56660, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not much of interest here for me.</td>', 'Not much of interest here for me.', '2004-01-26 14:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(557932, 56707, 7291, '<td valign="top">The black border is perhaps a little too thick but I like the use of black-light.</td>', 'The black border is perhaps a little too thick but I like the use of black-light.', '2004-01-26 14:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(557934, 56514, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very elegant presentation.  Perfect lighting.</td>', 'Very elegant presentation.  Perfect lighting.', '2004-01-26 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(557935, 57052, 15642, '<td valign="top">All the negative space up top isnt helping. Nicely lit otherwise...</td>', 'All the negative space up top isnt helping. Nicely lit otherwise...', '2004-01-26 14:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(557936, 56504, 8765, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2004-01-26 14:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(557937, 56769, 7291, '<td valign="top">I tried a similar shot once.  Check out my "Heart of a Flower" when you get a chance...if you want to that is.  hehe, anyway I really like this but feel there are some blow highlights of yellow.  Excellent picture overall and one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'I tried a similar shot once.  Check out my "Heart of a Flower" when you get a chance...if you want to that is.  hehe, anyway I really like this but feel there are some blow highlights of yellow.  Excellent picture overall and one of the best of the challenge.', '2004-01-26 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(557939, 56969, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great product shot.</td>', 'Great product shot.', '2004-01-26 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(557940, 56415, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. I''m not a big fan of the water droplets, but still quite nice.</td>', 'Nicely lit. I''m not a big fan of the water droplets, but still quite nice.', '2004-01-26 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(557941, 57053, 7291, '<td valign="top">That looks like some tricky lighting with the green coming from behind and the purple from the front.  Good job.</td>', 'That looks like some tricky lighting with the green coming from behind and the purple from the front.  Good job.', '2004-01-26 14:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(557942, 57027, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like this one allot but am having trouble figuring out what it is.</td>', 'Nice!  I like this one allot but am having trouble figuring out what it is.', '2004-01-26 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(557945, 55938, 7291, '<td valign="top">We all knew that there would be a fair amount of shots just like this, but this one is BY FAR the best execution!  There is no doubt that this should place for a ribbon and if not a blue one....then you got robbed!  Can''t wait to put this into my favorites</td>', 'We all knew that there would be a fair amount of shots just like this, but this one is BY FAR the best execution!  There is no doubt that this should place for a ribbon and if not a blue one....then you got robbed!  Can''t wait to put this into my favorites', '2004-01-26 14:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(557946, 56981, 7291, '<td valign="top">Good eye capturing the photo where most people would never see one.  I like how you included the oval in the background.</td>', 'Good eye capturing the photo where most people would never see one.  I like how you included the oval in the background.', '2004-01-26 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(557949, 56377, 7291, '<td valign="top">Dizzying and abstract.  I love it!!!  Excellent job!</td>', 'Dizzying and abstract.  I love it!!!  Excellent job!', '2004-01-26 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(557952, 55957, 7291, '<td valign="top">That''s kind''a cool!  Not sure how it was accomplished but it''s interesting.</td>', 'That''s kind''a cool!  Not sure how it was accomplished but it''s interesting.', '2004-01-26 14:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(557954, 56933, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like how the red line stops right before touching the glass.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like how the red line stops right before touching the glass.', '2004-01-26 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(557975, 56415, 6504, '<td valign="top">A-1 !!!!   The winner in my opinion.  The subtle lighting is perfect, the water, colors, texture,   all just right</td>', 'A-1 !!!!   The winner in my opinion.  The subtle lighting is perfect, the water, colors, texture,   all just right', '2004-01-26 15:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(557990, 57018, 6532, '<td valign="top">I think determination would be better seen in the child''s eye.... therefore, in my opinion this is where the light should have been.....still, good job</td>', 'I think determination would be better seen in the child''s eye.... therefore, in my opinion this is where the light should have been.....still, good job', '2004-01-26 15:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(558007, 56990, 16609, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of the red light to focus on the shadowy figure in the center of the picture.</td>', 'I really like the use of the red light to focus on the shadowy figure in the center of the picture.', '2004-01-26 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(558009, 56054, 6532, '<td valign="top">COuld have done without the shoelace being recolored....kinda sloppy.  Otherwise, nice pic.</td>', 'COuld have done without the shoelace being recolored....kinda sloppy.  Otherwise, nice pic.', '2004-01-26 16:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(558011, 55938, 8610, '<td valign="top">This is amazing picture.. Bravo well done - Hope you will tell us how you did this. And I also hope this picture will win - 10</td>', 'This is amazing picture.. Bravo well done - Hope you will tell us how you did this. And I also hope this picture will win - 10', '2004-01-26 16:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(558042, 57012, 15189, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great color.  A little noisy, but very good job.</td>', 'Nice composition and great color.  A little noisy, but very good job.', '2004-01-26 16:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(558043, 56809, 15189, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, can''t complain about a thing.  Good Job!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, can''t complain about a thing.  Good Job!', '2004-01-26 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(558049, 56377, 15189, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, love the pattern. Can''t complain about anything.  Good Job!</td>', 'Love this shot, love the pattern. Can''t complain about anything.  Good Job!', '2004-01-26 16:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(558050, 56929, 15189, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good composition, good color, great exposure!  High marks from me.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good composition, good color, great exposure!  High marks from me.', '2004-01-26 16:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(558052, 55938, 15189, '<td valign="top">Seems a couple of people had the same idea, but your execution of this idea is wonderful.  Maybe just a tiny bit over exposed and the tips of the brush, but I  like it that way.  A 10.</td>', 'Seems a couple of people had the same idea, but your execution of this idea is wonderful.  Maybe just a tiny bit over exposed and the tips of the brush, but I  like it that way.  A 10.', '2004-01-26 16:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(558054, 57041, 15189, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  It almost looks more like a painting.  I love the colors and the "texture" of the whole composition.  High marks from me.</td>', 'Love this shot.  It almost looks more like a painting.  I love the colors and the "texture" of the whole composition.  High marks from me.', '2004-01-26 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(558058, 57019, 15189, '<td valign="top">Wonderful interpretation of PWL.  Can''t find a thing wrong.</td>', 'Wonderful interpretation of PWL.  Can''t find a thing wrong.', '2004-01-26 16:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(558059, 56534, 15189, '<td valign="top">The light on the table is a bit distracting, as well as the angle of the vase (looks tilted), but overall I like your idea.  Nice job.</td>', 'The light on the table is a bit distracting, as well as the angle of the vase (looks tilted), but overall I like your idea.  Nice job.', '2004-01-26 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(558061, 56160, 15189, '<td valign="top">Really love this.  Like the lighting, colors and composition as well as the simplicity. Very nice job.</td>', 'Really love this.  Like the lighting, colors and composition as well as the simplicity. Very nice job.', '2004-01-26 16:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(558064, 57026, 15189, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ghostly game of chess.  Love the colors.  Good Job!</td>', 'Looks like a ghostly game of chess.  Love the colors.  Good Job!', '2004-01-26 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(558065, 57033, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and well executed.  The light coming from floor is a bit distracting.  Maybe if you had you subject positioned on something less shiny?  Over all very good job!</td>', 'Very nice idea and well executed.  The light coming from floor is a bit distracting.  Maybe if you had you subject positioned on something less shiny?  Over all very good job!', '2004-01-26 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(558067, 57018, 15189, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot for its simplicity and mystery.  Good Job!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot for its simplicity and mystery.  Good Job!', '2004-01-26 16:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(558069, 56563, 15189, '<td valign="top">I think it''s adorable!</td>', 'I think it''s adorable!', '2004-01-26 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(558072, 57040, 15189, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for its simplicity and mystery.  I would have liked to see the background completely black with just the outline of your subject visible.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this shot for its simplicity and mystery.  I would have liked to see the background completely black with just the outline of your subject visible.  Good job.', '2004-01-26 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(558073, 56415, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very nice still. Good color and exposure.  Placing the pair off to the side might have given the composition a bit more interest.  Good Job!</td>', 'Very nice still. Good color and exposure.  Placing the pair off to the side might have given the composition a bit more interest.  Good Job!', '2004-01-26 17:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(558099, 56227, 327, '<td valign="top">I admire your shot, great tones and wonderful moody lighting. Congrats.</td>', 'I admire your shot, great tones and wonderful moody lighting. Congrats.', '2004-01-26 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(558100, 57027, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract and colors. Well done.</td>', 'Cool abstract and colors. Well done.', '2004-01-26 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(558101, 56809, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is lovely to look at.  It seems as if the pears are glowing, that they are the source of the light.  A wonderful result using the effect called for.  I like the composition. I''m guessing some will say they think there is too much black at the top, but I think that blackness makes the pears seem all the more glowing, and gives a feeling of anticipation - what might the light shine on next?</td>', 'This is lovely to look at.  It seems as if the pears are glowing, that they are the source of the light.  A wonderful result using the effect called for.  I like the composition. I''m guessing some will say they think there is too much black at the top, but I think that blackness makes the pears seem all the more glowing, and gives a feeling of anticipation - what might the light shine on next?', '2004-01-26 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(558103, 56696, 327, '<td valign="top">This has a certain appeal. She is lovely ...the hair with the light and the softness. Very attractive shot. Congrats on a good shot for the challenge. I like to see more shots but a closer portrait.</td>', 'This has a certain appeal. She is lovely ...the hair with the light and the softness. Very attractive shot. Congrats on a good shot for the challenge. I like to see more shots but a closer portrait.', '2004-01-26 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(558109, 56707, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. I want to say that the bucket of paint looks as if it''s not part of this shot. It doesn''t seem to belong. ?Just a thought. I hope you do well in the challenge. 8</td>', 'Neat shot. I want to say that the bucket of paint looks as if it''s not part of this shot. It doesn''t seem to belong. ?Just a thought. I hope you do well in the challenge. 8', '2004-01-26 17:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(558111, 57033, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun!  I like how there is interest in both what the light shines on and the light itself.  I wish the floor were as dark as the rest of the background - it reminds us of reality when the photograph it trying to take us away on a flight of fancy.</td>', 'Fun!  I like how there is interest in both what the light shines on and the light itself.  I wish the floor were as dark as the rest of the background - it reminds us of reality when the photograph it trying to take us away on a flight of fancy.', '2004-01-26 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(558114, 56647, 7628, '<td valign="top">good idea - a halo effect.  Gives a nice dusting of light on the rest of the scene too.</td>', 'good idea - a halo effect.  Gives a nice dusting of light on the rest of the scene too.', '2004-01-26 17:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(558116, 57033, 16352, '<td valign="top">How many goes before you set him alight? The only thing I would have tried to do was to keep the sparkler  a bit further back to keep light off the hands. On second thoughts.....No. It''s right as it is</td>', 'How many goes before you set him alight? The only thing I would have tried to do was to keep the sparkler  a bit further back to keep light off the hands. On second thoughts.....No. It''s right as it is', '2004-01-26 17:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558119, 56541, 7628, '<td valign="top">an interesting effect.  Looks like green lava.  I''m thinking this would work well with something else - some familiar object or form to anchor it.  By itself it is too nebulous.</td>', 'an interesting effect.  Looks like green lava.  I''m thinking this would work well with something else - some familiar object or form to anchor it.  By itself it is too nebulous.', '2004-01-26 17:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(558123, 56054, 7628, '<td valign="top">fun!  Must have been hard to hold your hand steady enough to trace the laces.  The light works well to illuminate the boots too.</td>', 'fun!  Must have been hard to hold your hand steady enough to trace the laces.  The light works well to illuminate the boots too.', '2004-01-26 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(558126, 56276, 16352, '<td valign="top">Difficult to see any movement of the light source. Very nice use of light - I love the little halo at the bottom of the crescent but I have only marked it this low because it appears so static.</td>', 'Difficult to see any movement of the light source. Very nice use of light - I love the little halo at the bottom of the crescent but I have only marked it this low because it appears so static.', '2004-01-26 17:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(558128, 57043, 7628, '<td valign="top">The effect goes great with the title.  I wish the flowers were sharper - is this shot through slightly frosted glass?  Even cooler if the "waves of power" were closer together.</td>', 'The effect goes great with the title.  I wish the flowers were sharper - is this shot through slightly frosted glass?  Even cooler if the "waves of power" were closer together.', '2004-01-26 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(558129, 56643, 16352, '<td valign="top">Shame that the top of the head has been cropped and I cant see that ot has been "painted with light". It simply looks like 1 or more static lights.</td>', 'Shame that the top of the head has been cropped and I cant see that ot has been "painted with light". It simply looks like 1 or more static lights.', '2004-01-26 17:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(558135, 57055, 7628, '<td valign="top">I Iike the hats - I wish the one in the middle didn''t overlap with the woman''s face - I''d like to see her full silhouette.  I don''t detect a moving light - I think the picture is better without it, but I have to bring it up ''cause that is the competition.</td>', 'I Iike the hats - I wish the one in the middle didn''t overlap with the woman''s face - I''d like to see her full silhouette.  I don''t detect a moving light - I think the picture is better without it, but I have to bring it up ''cause that is the competition.', '2004-01-26 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(558137, 56345, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject.  I wish it were sharper, and perhaps less light because there are so many reflective objects the light glares a bit.</td>', 'Lovely subject.  I wish it were sharper, and perhaps less light because there are so many reflective objects the light glares a bit.', '2004-01-26 17:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(558139, 57026, 16352, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but I can''t see the "movement". Seems like static lighting rather than moving light or a build up of light from a long exposure and different light sources.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but I can''t see the "movement". Seems like static lighting rather than moving light or a build up of light from a long exposure and different light sources.', '2004-01-26 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(558145, 56504, 7628, '<td valign="top">very imaginative - the light becomes the subject painting on our imagination.  Wish the vase weren''t so far in the corner - maybe better on the "thirds line'' and the corner (the line in the center) is a bit distracting - a flat background would be better (or is the line an artifact of the light?)</td>', 'very imaginative - the light becomes the subject painting on our imagination.  Wish the vase weren''t so far in the corner - maybe better on the "thirds line'' and the corner (the line in the center) is a bit distracting - a flat background would be better (or is the line an artifact of the light?)', '2004-01-26 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(558146, 55940, 16352, '<td valign="top">One of the few I have seen so far which appears to really be "painting with light". I do think that the label detracts from the picture as a whole. It seems that it either should not be there at all or it should be sharper and crisper</td>', 'One of the few I have seen so far which appears to really be "painting with light". I do think that the label detracts from the picture as a whole. It seems that it either should not be there at all or it should be sharper and crisper', '2004-01-26 17:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(558152, 57015, 7628, '<td valign="top">The effect seems creates movement in the still object.  Is it the texture of the dancer that makes the light points?  or did you create that with the application?  The placemnt of the dancer is interesting - why have more black on her right.  I''d almost put more space for her to "move into" or balance the sides exactly.</td>', 'The effect seems creates movement in the still object.  Is it the texture of the dancer that makes the light points?  or did you create that with the application?  The placemnt of the dancer is interesting - why have more black on her right.  I''d almost put more space for her to "move into" or balance the sides exactly.', '2004-01-26 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(558154, 56754, 16352, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see where the light source has moved - It appears more like a static object with light coming from a strongly distorted source. I still like the image - lots to see in it but maybe (for me) not in this category</td>', 'Can''t really see where the light source has moved - It appears more like a static object with light coming from a strongly distorted source. I still like the image - lots to see in it but maybe (for me) not in this category', '2004-01-26 17:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(558155, 57028, 7628, '<td valign="top">The light catches the spikes so nicely.  I think it would have more impast without the brown rim of the pot at the bottom.</td>', 'The light catches the spikes so nicely.  I think it would have more impast without the brown rim of the pot at the bottom.', '2004-01-26 17:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(558162, 55933, 16352, '<td valign="top">A great picture - but (for me) not one that seems to be "painting with light" certainly is dramatic and well positioned and makes a sinister object even more sinister. There appears to be no "movement" of the light source or use of long exposure and seperate light sources to create what I would call painting with light</td>', 'A great picture - but (for me) not one that seems to be "painting with light" certainly is dramatic and well positioned and makes a sinister object even more sinister. There appears to be no "movement" of the light source or use of long exposure and seperate light sources to create what I would call painting with light', '2004-01-26 18:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(558163, 57012, 7628, '<td valign="top">The apples seem like the moon hanging in the night sky.  The effect works well.  The apple seem  a little gray or dusty - you''ll think I''m crazy - perhaps the colors on the apple need more contrast because the contrast between the apple and the black is so great? I like the placement of the apples in the blackness too -</td>', 'The apples seem like the moon hanging in the night sky.  The effect works well.  The apple seem  a little gray or dusty - you''ll think I''m crazy - perhaps the colors on the apple need more contrast because the contrast between the apple and the black is so great? I like the placement of the apples in the blackness too -', '2004-01-26 18:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(558166, 56849, 16352, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong - but this seems to be just a single flash - Not really fulfilling the competition guidelines - shame as it is a good grabbed shot</td>', 'I may be wrong - but this seems to be just a single flash - Not really fulfilling the competition guidelines - shame as it is a good grabbed shot', '2004-01-26 18:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(558168, 56111, 16352, '<td valign="top">At last - one that seems to use satisfy the criteria for the rules of "painting with light"</td>', 'At last - one that seems to use satisfy the criteria for the rules of "painting with light"', '2004-01-26 18:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(558169, 56791, 7628, '<td valign="top">cool effect - especially paired with this processing - Neon Shoes!  Abstract, but recognizable, and easy to relate to and enjoy. 9</td>', 'cool effect - especially paired with this processing - Neon Shoes!  Abstract, but recognizable, and easy to relate to and enjoy. 9', '2004-01-26 18:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(558171, 55933, 7628, '<td valign="top">The moving light has created a flickering feel - makes us look again to see if the gargoyle moved.  Very myterious and unnerving.  Lovely detail, great composition - 10</td>', 'The moving light has created a flickering feel - makes us look again to see if the gargoyle moved.  Very myterious and unnerving.  Lovely detail, great composition - 10', '2004-01-26 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(558172, 56346, 16352, '<td valign="top">This is a very evocative picture - and one I like very much but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations</td>', 'This is a very evocative picture - and one I like very much but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations', '2004-01-26 18:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(558174, 56984, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice job - the light picks out the sign and the bright color, leaving the rest cloaked in mystery.  You''ve acheived an effect with light instead of post processing. neat.</td>', 'nice job - the light picks out the sign and the bright color, leaving the rest cloaked in mystery.  You''ve acheived an effect with light instead of post processing. neat.', '2004-01-26 18:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(558175, 56744, 16352, '<td valign="top">Good background - the glass has retained its clarity - figurine has retained its texture but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations</td>', 'Good background - the glass has retained its clarity - figurine has retained its texture but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations', '2004-01-26 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(558177, 56660, 16352, '<td valign="top">at last - one of the few that does does  seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations</td>', 'at last - one of the few that does does  seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations', '2004-01-26 18:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(558180, 56645, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - a little overexposed - but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations</td>', 'Nice picture - a little overexposed - but does not seem to satisfy the principles of "painting with light" - either a moving light source or long exposure with repeated illumination from different locations', '2004-01-26 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(558181, 57052, 7628, '<td valign="top">The light adds a sweet nostalgic effect.  I''d crop the top down to where there is balance between the space above and below the bear.  Very sweet, warm.</td>', 'The light adds a sweet nostalgic effect.  I''d crop the top down to where there is balance between the space above and below the bear.  Very sweet, warm.', '2004-01-26 18:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(558183, 57046, 16352, '<td valign="top">Good crisp white - deep blacks - nice composition</td>', 'Good crisp white - deep blacks - nice composition', '2004-01-26 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(558184, 56707, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun idea - a literal interpretation, but very imaginative.  Nice glowing effect.  I''d skip the darker, green squiggles, and just have a bold sweep of the pink.  The color in the pot is a bit too deep, doesn;t match the color of the brush.</td>', 'Fun idea - a literal interpretation, but very imaginative.  Nice glowing effect.  I''d skip the darker, green squiggles, and just have a bold sweep of the pink.  The color in the pot is a bit too deep, doesn;t match the color of the brush.', '2004-01-26 18:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(558188, 55912, 7628, '<td valign="top">Simple. Very elegant.  The sweep of the light, the red of the brush all well done. 9</td>', 'Simple. Very elegant.  The sweep of the light, the red of the brush all well done. 9', '2004-01-26 18:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(558195, 56233, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of this plasma light!  Moving light - illuminates your hand and the glass.  Very cool result.  Looks like the ball is being suspended by some magical power of light that you are creating.  I like all the darkness around the subject.  good work. 9</td>', 'Nice use of this plasma light!  Moving light - illuminates your hand and the glass.  Very cool result.  Looks like the ball is being suspended by some magical power of light that you are creating.  I like all the darkness around the subject.  good work. 9', '2004-01-26 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(558199, 55938, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fantasia is a perfect title - the light reminds me of that.  Great effect.  Wish there wer a little less light around the handle of the brush - it takes away from the feeling the light is being laid out by the bristles. 8</td>', 'Fantasia is a perfect title - the light reminds me of that.  Great effect.  Wish there wer a little less light around the handle of the brush - it takes away from the feeling the light is being laid out by the bristles. 8', '2004-01-26 18:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(558201, 56922, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract... I''m not sure how strong this one is on the theme of painting with light because of the abstract nature of it.  You can''t really tell by looking at the image if this is a subject that has been painted with light or if the light is the subject of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting abstract... I''m not sure how strong this one is on the theme of painting with light because of the abstract nature of it.  You can''t really tell by looking at the image if this is a subject that has been painted with light or if the light is the subject of the photo.', '2004-01-26 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(558202, 56933, 7628, '<td valign="top">wow.  dynamic composition.  great use of color. elegant sweeps and angles bring the whole subject togther.  Good work with the challenge. 10</td>', 'wow.  dynamic composition.  great use of color. elegant sweeps and angles bring the whole subject togther.  Good work with the challenge. 10', '2004-01-26 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(558203, 55940, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is great fun - and neatly done.</td>', 'This is great fun - and neatly done.', '2004-01-26 18:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(558206, 56541, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  It has a painted feel to it.  With an abstract image in a challenge like this one, you may have a difficult time convincing the voter that you ''meet the challenge.''  When the subject is difficult to identify, it makes it more difficult to see the technique of painting with light.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  It has a painted feel to it.  With an abstract image in a challenge like this one, you may have a difficult time convincing the voter that you ''meet the challenge.''  When the subject is difficult to identify, it makes it more difficult to see the technique of painting with light.', '2004-01-26 18:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(558207, 56346, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo will likely suffer ''does not meet the challenge'' votes.  The scene itself is quite interesting but there doesn''t seem to be a moving light source that is being used to illuminate your subject.   That being said, I think this would have made a strong black and white with a slightly longer exposure (maybe one stop or so) and if you had not used the on camera flash.  You have mixed two different light temperatures in this image by doing that.  This shot needs a tripod and no flash :)</td>', 'This photo will likely suffer ''does not meet the challenge'' votes.  The scene itself is quite interesting but there doesn''t seem to be a moving light source that is being used to illuminate your subject.   That being said, I think this would have made a strong black and white with a slightly longer exposure (maybe one stop or so) and if you had not used the on camera flash.  You have mixed two different light temperatures in this image by doing that.  This shot needs a tripod and no flash :)', '2004-01-26 18:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558208, 57039, 7628, '<td valign="top">wonderful effect.  The lights themselves create a nice image, and they illuminate just the right parts of the face and neck to give this abstract form. 9</td>', 'wonderful effect.  The lights themselves create a nice image, and they illuminate just the right parts of the face and neck to give this abstract form. 9', '2004-01-26 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(558209, 56230, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean shot... looks almost good enough to use for a product advertisement.  The photo makes it difficult to see ''painting with light'' though.</td>', 'This is a very clean shot... looks almost good enough to use for a product advertisement.  The photo makes it difficult to see ''painting with light'' though.', '2004-01-26 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(558211, 57020, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo does not really illustrate the ''painting with light'' concept for me.  Painting with light involves a moving light to illuminate the subject.</td>', 'This photo does not really illustrate the ''painting with light'' concept for me.  Painting with light involves a moving light to illuminate the subject.', '2004-01-26 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(558212, 56494, 7628, '<td valign="top">neat effect - how did yo do this?  I like the refection of the lights in the hadlebar.    Nice composition - just enough of thebottom of the tricycle to ground the image.  But not the whole thing - then we pay more attntion to the shapes and less to the whole.  well thought out. 9</td>', 'neat effect - how did yo do this?  I like the refection of the lights in the hadlebar.    Nice composition - just enough of thebottom of the tricycle to ground the image.  But not the whole thing - then we pay more attntion to the shapes and less to the whole.  well thought out. 9', '2004-01-26 18:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(558217, 56645, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, but the light source seems to be stationary.  Moving the light source around during the exposure creates the ''painting with light'' effect.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, but the light source seems to be stationary.  Moving the light source around during the exposure creates the ''painting with light'' effect.', '2004-01-26 18:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
