(561601, 55940, 326, '<td valign="top">Cool! Great job!</td>', 'Cool! Great job!', '2004-01-29 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(561609, 57023, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice image. It''s crazy what different styles of glasses will do with a little light. I''ve done a couple photos like this with our glasses which are green and make an interesting pattern as well. I like the shades of blue/purple.</td>', 'Nice image. It''s crazy what different styles of glasses will do with a little light. I''ve done a couple photos like this with our glasses which are green and make an interesting pattern as well. I like the shades of blue/purple.', '2004-01-29 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(561611, 57040, 70, '<td valign="top">Lovely subtle image. You done just enough with the light to get the job done without overdoing it.</td>', 'Lovely subtle image. You done just enough with the light to get the job done without overdoing it.', '2004-01-29 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(561613, 56996, 326, '<td valign="top">Crazy &amp; Cool! I like it!</td>', 'Crazy & Cool! I like it!', '2004-01-29 01:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(561616, 56809, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice tones on the pears and good lighting. I find the grain of the wood a bit distracting...maybe an older, duller wood or a paper bag would have worked better?</td>', 'Nice tones on the pears and good lighting. I find the grain of the wood a bit distracting...maybe an older, duller wood or a paper bag would have worked better?', '2004-01-29 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(561617, 56690, 70, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus.', '2004-01-29 01:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(561618, 56772, 70, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting of the abstract lightings. I like the smooth gold parts at the bottom.</td>', 'One of the more interesting of the abstract lightings. I like the smooth gold parts at the bottom.', '2004-01-29 01:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(561621, 56377, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Such a simple thing but the lighting makes it really cool. Good placement of the strings, too.</td>', 'I really like this. Such a simple thing but the lighting makes it really cool. Good placement of the strings, too.', '2004-01-29 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(561636, 57018, 8891, '<td valign="top">toooooooo much shadow....</td>', 'toooooooo much shadow....', '2004-01-29 02:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(561638, 57010, 8891, '<td valign="top">the position of the shells is bothersome to me in this ....Don''t know why needed too lok out of place....the top right one, that is.   The lighting is quite good as is the detail and focus. if the crop was not so tight you might have gotten away with this placement of the shells</td>', 'the position of the shells is bothersome to me in this ....Don''t know why needed too lok out of place....the top right one, that is.   The lighting is quite good as is the detail and focus. if the crop was not so tight you might have gotten away with this placement of the shells', '2004-01-29 02:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(561642, 56643, 8891, '<td valign="top">The blowout on the figureine is very distracting and I think the overall lighting of it could have been lessened. You might have a more mysterious looking result. The less bright of the green is not a bad color and I like it against the background color.</td>', 'The blowout on the figureine is very distracting and I think the overall lighting of it could have been lessened. You might have a more mysterious looking result. The less bright of the green is not a bad color and I like it against the background color.', '2004-01-29 02:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(561644, 56160, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2004-01-29 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(561645, 56769, 12160, '<td valign="top">stunning! 9</td>', 'stunning! 9', '2004-01-29 02:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(561646, 57055, 8891, '<td valign="top">Too much in the frame, thought i do not mind the frame.  THere is a little bit of something metaillic looking , could that be a ring, pardner? are you getting hitched by a minute justice of the peace... hmmmm. works a bit but just too tight. hope the ring is not.</td>', 'Too much in the frame, thought i do not mind the frame.  THere is a little bit of something metaillic looking , could that be a ring, pardner? are you getting hitched by a minute justice of the peace... hmmmm. works a bit but just too tight. hope the ring is not.', '2004-01-29 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(561647, 57048, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and colors. great image.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and colors. great image.', '2004-01-29 02:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(561648, 56415, 12160, '<td valign="top">love it.</td>', 'love it.', '2004-01-29 02:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(561649, 56990, 12160, '<td valign="top">wow! awesome lighting.</td>', 'wow! awesome lighting.', '2004-01-29 02:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(561651, 56809, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo. nice colors and good use of light.</td>', 'beautiful photo. nice colors and good use of light.', '2004-01-29 02:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(561652, 57041, 8891, '<td valign="top">THe lghiting and the colors in this are very well done, extremely well done I might say.  I like the plant form against the background very much!  Composition is just a little weak,  I think. The center of the plant is dead center of the frame and should have been a bit to the (my) right.  Other than that excellent!</td>', 'THe lghiting and the colors in this are very well done, extremely well done I might say.  I like the plant form against the background very much!  Composition is just a little weak,  I think. The center of the plant is dead center of the frame and should have been a bit to the (my) right.  Other than that excellent!', '2004-01-29 02:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561653, 56494, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful! 9</td>', 'beautiful! 9', '2004-01-29 02:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(561660, 56547, 3540, '<td valign="top">This has a really eerie Halloween type feel to it.  Not sure if its the colors or if it reminds me of something I''ve seen in a movie somehwere, maybe "Carrie".   I think its a pretty neat shot though and a good idea.6</td>', 'This has a really eerie Halloween type feel to it.  Not sure if its the colors or if it reminds me of something I''ve seen in a movie somehwere, maybe "Carrie".   I think its a pretty neat shot though and a good idea.6', '2004-01-29 02:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(561661, 56160, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I would''ve like to see the light diffused a bit more and generally softer.  I think it would''ve added a little more of the element of mood to the picture.  Still a good photo.</td>', 'Good composition.  I would''ve like to see the light diffused a bit more and generally softer.  I think it would''ve added a little more of the element of mood to the picture.  Still a good photo.', '2004-01-29 02:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(561662, 57039, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo.  The best I''ve seen so far hands down.  nice job 9</td>', 'This is a really neat photo.  The best I''ve seen so far hands down.  nice job 9', '2004-01-29 02:41:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(561663, 56769, 3540, '<td valign="top">The light on the outside of the petals is a little bit harsh.  Pretty good otherwise.</td>', 'The light on the outside of the petals is a little bit harsh.  Pretty good otherwise.', '2004-01-29 02:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(561668, 55938, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  I had the same idea but went with something else.  I''m glad I did, yours is way better.  Nice shot 9</td>', 'This is excellent.  I had the same idea but went with something else.  I''m glad I did, yours is way better.  Nice shot 9', '2004-01-29 03:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(561669, 56415, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Real good clarity on the drops.  Would''ve liked to have seen maybe a bit more of the pear, but this is really well done.  Nice work 8</td>', 'Nice work.  Real good clarity on the drops.  Would''ve liked to have seen maybe a bit more of the pear, but this is really well done.  Nice work 8', '2004-01-29 03:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(561676, 56233, 16703, '<td valign="top">i think this is teh best plasma photo i have seen yet.. great job! the only suggestion i can make from my humble opinion is that i think i would like the hand better if it was may be a little more exposed...perhaps from underneath.. but it already is a great photo...</td>', 'i think this is teh best plasma photo i have seen yet.. great job! the only suggestion i can make from my humble opinion is that i think i would like the hand better if it was may be a little more exposed...perhaps from underneath.. but it already is a great photo...', '2004-01-29 03:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(561677, 57039, 16703, '<td valign="top">very well done... i think this is one of the best in "painting with light" challenge..</td>', 'very well done... i think this is one of the best in "painting with light" challenge..', '2004-01-29 03:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(561678, 56465, 16703, '<td valign="top">i do not want to be harsh critisizing or anything like that but i really dont think that the composition builds upto anything. backgroudn and foreground seems to be battling one another...may be if the foregroudn light was dimmer and a more meaningful shape and the head was places more appropriately relative to the foreground light, this could have been a more appealing picture..</td>', 'i do not want to be harsh critisizing or anything like that but i really dont think that the composition builds upto anything. backgroudn and foreground seems to be battling one another...may be if the foregroudn light was dimmer and a more meaningful shape and the head was places more appropriately relative to the foreground light, this could have been a more appealing picture..', '2004-01-29 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(561680, 56054, 16703, '<td valign="top">i dont think i have anything to say for this photo other than "super cool"...</td>', 'i dont think i have anything to say for this photo other than "super cool"...', '2004-01-29 04:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(561683, 56849, 7687, '<td valign="top">IMHO, using a flash could be considered "painting with light" but in this case it''s simply an on camera flash...which doesn''t really constitute anything particularly inventive or interesting.  <br/> <br/>That being said, this shot is entirely too underexposed, the skier barely stands out against the black sky.  <br/> <br/>Not only does this not meet the challenge, the image is poorly done.  I''m sorry but I have to give this shot a 1 for meeting the challenge, a 1 for artistic merit and a 1 for technique.  <br/> <br/>In this particular instance 1+1+1=1.</td>', 'IMHO, using a flash could be considered "painting with light" but in this case it''s simply an on camera flash...which doesn''t really constitute anything particularly inventive or interesting.   That being said, this shot is entirely too underexposed, the skier barely stands out against the black sky.   Not only does this not meet the challenge, the image is poorly done.  I''m sorry but I have to give this shot a 1 for meeting the challenge, a 1 for artistic merit and a 1 for technique.   In this particular instance 1+1+1=1.', '2004-01-29 04:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(561694, 56933, 12654, '<td valign="top">Real nice colour - i love the laser on the olive.<br/>Good perspective and overall - a great picture</td>', 'Real nice colour - i love the laser on the olive.Good perspective and overall - a great picture', '2004-01-29 05:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(561716, 55933, 92, '<td valign="top">I like how the face is in thirds and the frame works well, too. The lighting and tone are great for this photo.</td>', 'I like how the face is in thirds and the frame works well, too. The lighting and tone are great for this photo.', '2004-01-29 06:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(561718, 57039, 92, '<td valign="top">This has great colors. The light isn''t over exposed in areas. The subject is beautiful and appealing. I think this is really outside the box and amazing. Good luck !</td>', 'This has great colors. The light isn''t over exposed in areas. The subject is beautiful and appealing. I think this is really outside the box and amazing. Good luck !', '2004-01-29 06:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(561719, 56929, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition with just the right amount of soft light. Nothing over or under exposed. VERY well done !</td>', 'Beautiful composition with just the right amount of soft light. Nothing over or under exposed. VERY well done !', '2004-01-29 06:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(561720, 55938, 92, '<td valign="top">oh I love this ! The light is perfect all over ! I love the soft feel on and around the brush. This is a winner ! Good luck ! = 10</td>', 'oh I love this ! The light is perfect all over ! I love the soft feel on and around the brush. This is a winner ! Good luck ! = 10', '2004-01-29 06:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(561721, 56514, 14401, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I''m gonna have to try this.</td>', 'Lovely!  I''m gonna have to try this.', '2004-01-29 06:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(561722, 56160, 92, '<td valign="top">The subject and lighting are beautiful. The colors are deep and rich which lend to the textures. The only small issue I have is the composition. The subject is too centered in the frame. Maybe move it to the left and down some or crop the left and bottom off a little. That would give this that WOW composition. Good luck !<br/></td>', 'The subject and lighting are beautiful. The colors are deep and rich which lend to the textures. The only small issue I have is the composition. The subject is too centered in the frame. Maybe move it to the left and down some or crop the left and bottom off a little. That would give this that WOW composition. Good luck !', '2004-01-29 06:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(561723, 56769, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The composition and light are beautiful. The only thing I would like to change is that spot on the center orange area. That yellow gives it over exposed look to it and draws the eye from the beautiful of this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful. The composition and light are beautiful. The only thing I would like to change is that spot on the center orange area. That yellow gives it over exposed look to it and draws the eye from the beautiful of this photo.', '2004-01-29 07:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
