(562195, 55940, 14035, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and I like the way the  strand of light seems to bend over itself but there is no clear focal point for me to rest my eyes upon.  Perhaps a broader arc to the light  that falls off the page to the right and the bottle closer to the left,, Very good technically - clear, sharp and the lighting is good.</td>', 'I like your idea and I like the way the  strand of light seems to bend over itself but there is no clear focal point for me to rest my eyes upon.  Perhaps a broader arc to the light  that falls off the page to the right and the bottle closer to the left,, Very good technically - clear, sharp and the lighting is good.', '2004-01-29 17:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(562200, 56465, 14035, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and I _love_ the colors - but the composition - falling as it does off the left side - is distracting. Hard to control the light, I imagine, a fire being somewhat unpredicatable.</td>', 'I like the idea and I _love_ the colors - but the composition - falling as it does off the left side - is distracting. Hard to control the light, I imagine, a fire being somewhat unpredicatable.', '2004-01-29 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(562201, 56933, 16271, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2004-01-29 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(562207, 56690, 14035, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good although I might have left more on the left and right (personal preference).  The focus is quite soft  - but that might be a function of the camera (lots of cameras will have difficulty in this  sort of challenge if they don''t have AE lock). Your choice of subject was very good, I think.</td>', 'The composition is very good although I might have left more on the left and right (personal preference).  The focus is quite soft  - but that might be a function of the camera (lots of cameras will have difficulty in this  sort of challenge if they don''t have AE lock). Your choice of subject was very good, I think.', '2004-01-29 17:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
