(562944, 56377, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the abstract quality here.  Don''t think natural light meets the challenge.</td>', 'Like the abstract quality here.  Don''t think natural light meets the challenge.', '2004-01-30 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(562945, 56484, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  Minor nit - blue thing in lower right detracts a bit from overall thin, flowing lines.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  Minor nit - blue thing in lower right detracts a bit from overall thin, flowing lines.', '2004-01-30 08:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(562946, 55957, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here.  A bit more black would have made a more powerful shot.</td>', 'I like your idea here.  A bit more black would have made a more powerful shot.', '2004-01-30 08:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(562948, 57010, 14614, '<td valign="top">Good use of black space, interesting subjects - somehow I thnk the shot needs more punch</td>', 'Good use of black space, interesting subjects - somehow I thnk the shot needs more punch', '2004-01-30 08:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(562949, 57049, 14614, '<td valign="top">End metal thing detract a bit, overall nice colors and composition</td>', 'End metal thing detract a bit, overall nice colors and composition', '2004-01-30 08:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(562950, 56990, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet this took a shot or two to get!  I like the shooting red lines and the three faces with fire around them.  Would like the two side faces to be symetrical.</td>', 'I''ll bet this took a shot or two to get!  I like the shooting red lines and the three faces with fire around them.  Would like the two side faces to be symetrical.', '2004-01-30 08:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(562951, 56660, 14614, '<td valign="top">Cropped a bit tight on right.</td>', 'Cropped a bit tight on right.', '2004-01-30 08:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(562952, 56230, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice but how does that fit the theme...</td>', 'Nice but how does that fit the theme...', '2004-01-30 08:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(562965, 57045, 4258, '<td valign="top">Love the colors on this one</td>', 'Love the colors on this one', '2004-01-30 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(562966, 56707, 4258, '<td valign="top">bit of noise reduction would have helped...</td>', 'bit of noise reduction would have helped...', '2004-01-30 09:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(562986, 56971, 14614, '<td valign="top">Would like more symetry in the two glasses (same height, tilt, light above)</td>', 'Would like more symetry in the two glasses (same height, tilt, light above)', '2004-01-30 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(563000, 57028, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am not quite comprehending the long thick area of dark brown at the bottom and the too similarly colored frame. I like the effect of the lighting on the cactus very much.</td>', 'I am not quite comprehending the long thick area of dark brown at the bottom and the too similarly colored frame. I like the effect of the lighting on the cactus very much.', '2004-01-30 10:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(563015, 56549, 7350, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like the little star-bursts on the statue, I like the "halo" around the shadow, and I love the composition and colors.  Congratulations!  10.</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like the little star-bursts on the statue, I like the "halo" around the shadow, and I love the composition and colors.  Congratulations!  10.', '2004-01-30 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(563017, 56160, 7350, '<td valign="top">Something about the simplicity of this shot really grabs me.  You have chosen a subject with nice texture, and your lighting is quite dramatic.  Nice.  10.</td>', 'Something about the simplicity of this shot really grabs me.  You have chosen a subject with nice texture, and your lighting is quite dramatic.  Nice.  10.', '2004-01-30 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(563018, 55940, 7350, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how you did this!  Very nice.  10.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how you did this!  Very nice.  10.', '2004-01-30 10:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(563022, 55933, 9628, '<td valign="top">Great light and very menacing as well. Like a monster appearing from nowhere...<br/> <br/>Is it a large statue or a small figure you have used?<br/>/KOB</td>', 'Great light and very menacing as well. Like a monster appearing from nowhere... Is it a large statue or a small figure you have used?/KOB', '2004-01-30 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563026, 57055, 9628, '<td valign="top">Like it... Very "clean" photo with regards to the other contestants, where most of them choose one or several bright colours to illustrate the point...<br/>... The only thing that disturbs the picture is the thing that the child holds in his or hers hand? Distracts me into trying to figure out what it is,,, Is it the camera?<br/> <br/>KOB</td>', 'Like it... Very "clean" photo with regards to the other contestants, where most of them choose one or several bright colours to illustrate the point...... The only thing that disturbs the picture is the thing that the child holds in his or hers hand? Distracts me into trying to figure out what it is,,, Is it the camera? KOB', '2004-01-30 10:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(563027, 57039, 9628, '<td valign="top">Very mystic... Nice touch. Is it smoke, painted with blue / green light?</td>', 'Very mystic... Nice touch. Is it smoke, painted with blue / green light?', '2004-01-30 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(563028, 55940, 9628, '<td valign="top">I think this photo stands out - at least I''m puzzeled with regards to what I am seeing (the white arc, that is...)...<br/> <br/>Like it...<br/> <br/>/KOB</td>', 'I think this photo stands out - at least I''m puzzeled with regards to what I am seeing (the white arc, that is...)... Like it... /KOB', '2004-01-30 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(563029, 55938, 9628, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Good tones and colours...<br/>/KOB</td>', 'Very nice... Good tones and colours.../KOB', '2004-01-30 10:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(563032, 56969, 9628, '<td valign="top">But it''s a Nokia, isn''t it? How can that be next generation?<br/>Go Sony-Ericsson, Go!!!<br/> <br/>Good shot, despite your choice of mobile phone...<br/>:-) KOB<br/></td>', 'But it''s a Nokia, isn''t it? How can that be next generation?Go Sony-Ericsson, Go!!! Good shot, despite your choice of mobile phone...:-) KOB', '2004-01-30 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(563049, 57039, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, meets the challenge well. A little blurr on the face, but still one of the best.</td>', 'Very nice shot, meets the challenge well. A little blurr on the face, but still one of the best.', '2004-01-30 11:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(563051, 57033, 13136, '<td valign="top">Now that I think of it, I''m surprised not to see more sparkler shots. Good take on the challenge, one of the best.</td>', 'Now that I think of it, I''m surprised not to see more sparkler shots. Good take on the challenge, one of the best.', '2004-01-30 11:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(563052, 55938, 13136, '<td valign="top">Well done. I might like to have seen farther back on the light trail and maybe a hand holding the brush, but still one of the three best in the challenge.</td>', 'Well done. I might like to have seen farther back on the light trail and maybe a hand holding the brush, but still one of the three best in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563053, 56646, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the moving lights are (at least it is not obvious to me), but still a very nice shot.</td>', 'Not sure where the moving lights are (at least it is not obvious to me), but still a very nice shot.', '2004-01-30 11:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(563055, 57023, 13136, '<td valign="top">Simple, but effective. It''s good that the ripples in the glass show up in the light on the table.</td>', 'Simple, but effective. It''s good that the ripples in the glass show up in the light on the table.', '2004-01-30 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(563060, 56504, 13136, '<td valign="top">A genii coming out of the bottle? Cool effects.</td>', 'A genii coming out of the bottle? Cool effects.', '2004-01-30 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(563061, 56549, 16632, '<td valign="top">i like this picture extremely .... it''s not just the picture itself. the title ''heaven &amp; hell'' really generates feelings in me ... it''s a really cool picture.</td>', 'i like this picture extremely .... it''s not just the picture itself. the title ''heaven & hell'' really generates feelings in me ... it''s a really cool picture.', '2004-01-30 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(563064, 56541, 13136, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too abstract for me. Not sure what I am looking at. I like the color and effect though.</td>', 'It''s a little too abstract for me. Not sure what I am looking at. I like the color and effect though.', '2004-01-30 11:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563072, 55957, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors (I''m color crazy). Your title may be a bit too correct though. The candle actually looks faded behind all those lines. Was this a monitor shot with the candle reflected?</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors (I''m color crazy). Your title may be a bit too correct though. The candle actually looks faded behind all those lines. Was this a monitor shot with the candle reflected?', '2004-01-30 11:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(563076, 56465, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and effect. I feel like the edges of the light should not have been cropped out and the line along the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea and effect. I feel like the edges of the light should not have been cropped out and the line along the bottom is distracting.', '2004-01-30 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(563081, 55933, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Almost looks as if lit by firelight. Maybe a red tint would enhance that impression. On the second go through, I upped the score on this one point. Looks even better the second time around.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Almost looks as if lit by firelight. Maybe a red tint would enhance that impression. On the second go through, I upped the score on this one point. Looks even better the second time around.', '2004-01-30 11:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(563082, 55898, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting glass flower. There is nothing in this shot to indicate to me that the light source was moving.</td>', 'Interesting glass flower. There is nothing in this shot to indicate to me that the light source was moving.', '2004-01-30 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(563085, 56230, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly interesting shot to me. Nothing to indicate that there was a non-stationary light source.</td>', 'Not a particularly interesting shot to me. Nothing to indicate that there was a non-stationary light source.', '2004-01-30 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(563087, 57022, 13136, '<td valign="top">The setting (steel bowl) really adds nothing to this shot. Also, there is nothing that indicates to me that the light source was moving.</td>', 'The setting (steel bowl) really adds nothing to this shot. Also, there is nothing that indicates to me that the light source was moving.', '2004-01-30 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(563088, 57040, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting back-light idea. Still a bit dark and no indication that light source was moving as challenge states.</td>', 'Interesting back-light idea. Still a bit dark and no indication that light source was moving as challenge states.', '2004-01-30 11:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(563092, 56233, 13136, '<td valign="top">With all the complaints on some threads about ''Too many plasma ball shots'' you are brave. Looks good to me and fits the challenge nicely. Good luck.</td>', 'With all the complaints on some threads about ''Too many plasma ball shots'' you are brave. Looks good to me and fits the challenge nicely. Good luck.', '2004-01-30 12:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(563094, 57017, 13136, '<td valign="top">Meaning is not real clear here, although the challenge was well met.</td>', 'Meaning is not real clear here, although the challenge was well met.', '2004-01-30 12:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(563098, 56969, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the ''moving'' lights are in this picture.</td>', 'Not sure where the ''moving'' lights are in this picture.', '2004-01-30 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(563121, 56514, 16608, '<td valign="top">An absolutely beautiful shot and subject matter. If I could vote i''d give it a 10</td>', 'An absolutely beautiful shot and subject matter. If I could vote i''d give it a 10', '2004-01-30 13:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563178, 56346, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is such a good idea.  The near snow distracts my eye from the rest of the composition</td>', 'This is such a good idea.  The near snow distracts my eye from the rest of the composition', '2004-01-30 14:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(563328, 56518, 3599, '<td valign="top">You may have wanted to take advantage of the editing rules and done some spot editing on the various blemishes including the piece of dust or lint in the lower right corner.  Nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'You may have wanted to take advantage of the editing rules and done some spot editing on the various blemishes including the piece of dust or lint in the lower right corner.  Nice photo otherwise.', '2004-01-30 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(563336, 56929, 6130, '<td valign="top">I love tulips and this pic.</td>', 'I love tulips and this pic.', '2004-01-30 16:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563337, 57033, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think this is really cool effect.  Two things that I might change go with darker socks to make the outfit uniform.  Head up maybe looking up to the sky/ceiling instead of down.  Just observations it still cool looking.</td>', 'I think this is really cool effect.  Two things that I might change go with darker socks to make the outfit uniform.  Head up maybe looking up to the sky/ceiling instead of down.  Just observations it still cool looking.', '2004-01-30 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(563351, 57015, 14211, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....how did you take it ?</td>', 'Beautiful....how did you take it ?', '2004-01-30 17:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(563354, 57049, 14211, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2004-01-30 17:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(563357, 55957, 14211, '<td valign="top">Nice effect</td>', 'Nice effect', '2004-01-30 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(563367, 56809, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very soft lighting makes this very moody. I like how you arranged the pears making colors gradute from yellow to orange. Very nice touch. Reflections on the wooden table is also very good. Maybe a tiny crop at the top. Kind of feels a little uneven and unbalance. "10"</td>', 'Very soft lighting makes this very moody. I like how you arranged the pears making colors gradute from yellow to orange. Very nice touch. Reflections on the wooden table is also very good. Maybe a tiny crop at the top. Kind of feels a little uneven and unbalance. "10"', '2004-01-30 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(563444, 57027, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice abstract</td>', 'nice abstract', '2004-01-30 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(563448, 55912, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice one. ..</td>', 'nice one. ..', '2004-01-30 18:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(563449, 55957, 11793, '<td valign="top">curious how this was accomplished.</td>', 'curious how this was accomplished.', '2004-01-30 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(563450, 55938, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done...<br/></td>', 'well done...', '2004-01-30 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(563500, 57046, 16703, '<td valign="top">wow... this does capture the moment of despair picture accurate :) 9</td>', 'wow... this does capture the moment of despair picture accurate :) 9', '2004-01-30 20:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563501, 56549, 16703, '<td valign="top">very cool in deed... nice shadow</td>', 'very cool in deed... nice shadow', '2004-01-30 20:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563502, 57035, 16703, '<td valign="top">i like how one candle is shorter than the other....suberb colors.. nice photo.. 8</td>', 'i like how one candle is shorter than the other....suberb colors.. nice photo.. 8', '2004-01-30 20:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(563527, 57046, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the light to spotlight the areas of focus. Really helps to tell a story. Great contrast. I like the textures that you were able to capture on the wall. "10".</td>', 'I like how you used the light to spotlight the areas of focus. Really helps to tell a story. Great contrast. I like the textures that you were able to capture on the wall. "10".', '2004-01-30 20:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(563531, 56415, 10084, '<td valign="top">Ligting really helps to show off the great curved contour of the pear. Nice reflections in the water droplets. The black background really makes the shot pop out. "10"</td>', 'Ligting really helps to show off the great curved contour of the pear. Nice reflections in the water droplets. The black background really makes the shot pop out. "10"', '2004-01-30 20:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(563533, 56808, 10084, '<td valign="top">You were able to get some great feeling of the curved contour of Cartman with the laser. Using the curved strokes really help. He really stands out with the dark background and the bright red.</td>', 'You were able to get some great feeling of the curved contour of Cartman with the laser. Using the curved strokes really help. He really stands out with the dark background and the bright red.', '2004-01-30 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(563536, 56981, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle that the sunlight has created from the side of a building. Kind of abstract. The light points toward the pole and makes your eyes focus on the graphiti.</td>', 'Interesting angle that the sunlight has created from the side of a building. Kind of abstract. The light points toward the pole and makes your eyes focus on the graphiti.', '2004-01-30 20:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(563550, 56484, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field. Focusing on the subjects are very good. Interesting colors on them. Beautiful shapes and shadows are formed by the lighting. They almost look like shrimp."10"</td>', 'Great depth of field. Focusing on the subjects are very good. Interesting colors on them. Beautiful shapes and shadows are formed by the lighting. They almost look like shrimp."10"', '2004-01-30 21:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(563552, 56984, 10084, '<td valign="top">The blue sign is bring your eyes right to it because of the great contrasting colors. The background really helps bring out the sign. The silhouettes have some nice abstract shapes.</td>', 'The blue sign is bring your eyes right to it because of the great contrasting colors. The background really helps bring out the sign. The silhouettes have some nice abstract shapes.', '2004-01-30 21:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(563566, 56933, 16230, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know the story behind this one. Very nice.</td>', 'I''d like to know the story behind this one. Very nice.', '2004-01-30 21:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(563585, 56707, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done..  black light? - no dust</td>', 'well done..  black light? - no dust', '2004-01-30 22:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(563595, 56504, 5822, '<td valign="top">You have certainly exhibited that you know the technique of painting with light, however, I find little artistic value here. The commonplace and drab background and dark, undistinguished bottle summon the impression  that this was little more than a hasty science experiment gone bad, or maybe fireworks out of control.</td>', 'You have certainly exhibited that you know the technique of painting with light, however, I find little artistic value here. The commonplace and drab background and dark, undistinguished bottle summon the impression  that this was little more than a hasty science experiment gone bad, or maybe fireworks out of control.', '2004-01-30 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(563600, 55938, 9546, '<td valign="top">Really cool, interesting idea, Excellent!!!!</td>', 'Really cool, interesting idea, Excellent!!!!', '2004-01-30 23:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(563605, 56233, 9546, '<td valign="top">Wow.... great photo. Maybe would have cropped it more.</td>', 'Wow.... great photo. Maybe would have cropped it more.', '2004-01-30 23:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(563607, 56484, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors are really beautiful and lighting is interesting, although a little hot on the pink petals. Background has speckles and streaks, probbly from lint.  Not sure what that blob is in the bottom right (a leaf?) but would rather not have it overlaying the flowers, if it''s to be in the picture at all as it seems out of place.  Composition seems haphazard.</td>', 'Colors are really beautiful and lighting is interesting, although a little hot on the pink petals. Background has speckles and streaks, probbly from lint.  Not sure what that blob is in the bottom right (a leaf?) but would rather not have it overlaying the flowers, if it''s to be in the picture at all as it seems out of place.  Composition seems haphazard.', '2004-01-30 23:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(563613, 57053, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice psychadelic colors and great concept that was done very well. I like that you can see some texture in the metal arm and cartridge,  I just find the background to be distracting and think it should have been either completely black or blurred even more than it is.  The yellow from the right is a bit too hot and should have been toned down as well. Overall I find it creative and I like it.</td>', 'Nice psychadelic colors and great concept that was done very well. I like that you can see some texture in the metal arm and cartridge,  I just find the background to be distracting and think it should have been either completely black or blurred even more than it is.  The yellow from the right is a bit too hot and should have been toned down as well. Overall I find it creative and I like it.', '2004-01-30 23:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(563617, 56402, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great diagonal composition makes your eyes follow the figures. I like how the foreground figure has it''s arm half exposed, really makes the shot dynamic and adds a lot of motion to the shot. I wished that the light on the figures were as bright as the one in the back. "9"</td>', 'Great diagonal composition makes your eyes follow the figures. I like how the foreground figure has it''s arm half exposed, really makes the shot dynamic and adds a lot of motion to the shot. I wished that the light on the figures were as bright as the one in the back. "9"', '2004-01-30 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(563618, 56735, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition gives a feeling of being underwater. Lot''s of abstracts and curves in the shot makes it interesting. Color combination is very distinct and vivid.</td>', 'The composition gives a feeling of being underwater. Lot''s of abstracts and curves in the shot makes it interesting. Color combination is very distinct and vivid.', '2004-01-30 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(563642, 57037, 16676, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting angle.... a very good pic.</td>', 'Excellent lighting angle.... a very good pic.', '2004-01-31 01:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(563647, 56969, 16676, '<td valign="top">I''d have preffered the lighting a little skewed.<br/></td>', 'I''d have preffered the lighting a little skewed.', '2004-01-31 01:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(563765, 57034, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much but the hot spots on top detract. Also, I"m not sure I like the dusky color of the leaves...would probably prefer to see them with a bit more of dark green.</td>', 'I like the composition very much but the hot spots on top detract. Also, I"m not sure I like the dusky color of the leaves...would probably prefer to see them with a bit more of dark green.', '2004-01-31 08:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563766, 56054, 5158, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this was done, but it is one of my favorits for sure. I especially like how you set the light on the boots. A 9 from me.</td>', 'Not sure how this was done, but it is one of my favorits for sure. I especially like how you set the light on the boots. A 9 from me.', '2004-01-31 08:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(563846, 57033, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative and right on the schallange. Do like how the boy is lit by the light. One of my favorits. Good luck</td>', 'Wonderfully creative and right on the schallange. Do like how the boy is lit by the light. One of my favorits. Good luck', '2004-01-31 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(563851, 56929, 16363, '<td valign="top">it looks like the tulips are glowing, really beautiful!</td>', 'it looks like the tulips are glowing, really beautiful!', '2004-01-31 11:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(563855, 56825, 16363, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2004-01-31 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(563856, 56707, 16363, '<td valign="top">You really are painting with light! Very nice effect!</td>', 'You really are painting with light! Very nice effect!', '2004-01-31 11:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(563971, 56744, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cute, but the ball is such a focal point that it really needs to be in focus too.</td>', 'Cute, but the ball is such a focal point that it really needs to be in focus too.', '2004-01-31 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(563975, 56494, 7485, '<td valign="top">Striking use of a neon-glow PS filter (or some such filter), but did you "use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand) as the primary method of illumination"?</td>', 'Striking use of a neon-glow PS filter (or some such filter), but did you "use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand) as the primary method of illumination"?', '2004-01-31 14:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(563990, 55938, 7204, '<td valign="top">very cool picture!  the only change i would make would be to get rid of th light under the brush...since the brush hasn''t made it there yet.</td>', 'very cool picture!  the only change i would make would be to get rid of th light under the brush...since the brush hasn''t made it there yet.', '2004-01-31 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(564003, 56534, 16787, '<td valign="top">Good colour</td>', 'Good colour', '2004-01-31 15:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
