(564404, 56220, 8891, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.likee the idea of the framing with bottom rose going over the frame, nice touch....but you might thin about losing the bit of stem below the frame...it''s a bit distracting. Very nice lighting , exposure and detail and I like the perspective of the roses from front to back.</td>', 'Hmmm.likee the idea of the framing with bottom rose going over the frame, nice touch....but you might thin about losing the bit of stem below the frame...it''s a bit distracting. Very nice lighting , exposure and detail and I like the perspective of the roses from front to back.', '2004-02-01 14:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(564406, 56647, 8891, '<td valign="top">the sacra couer effect from the blowout  might have been dealt with, I think...Maybe light through caus from above... The halo effect is quite good on the cross, .perhaps you could have masked the areas of your lighting equipment so they did not hit the metallic statue as harshly as it did. Don''t know for sure.  Very nice effort and good detail on the statue and cross.</td>', 'the sacra couer effect from the blowout  might have been dealt with, I think...Maybe light through caus from above... The halo effect is quite good on the cross, .perhaps you could have masked the areas of your lighting equipment so they did not hit the metallic statue as harshly as it did. Don''t know for sure.  Very nice effort and good detail on the statue and cross.', '2004-02-01 14:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(564408, 56660, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting, well maybe except for the blowout on the right, and the colors and the detail...just don''t like the subject... Great shadow, like the colors as they diminish beyond the subject.</td>', 'Like the lighting, well maybe except for the blowout on the right, and the colors and the detail...just don''t like the subject... Great shadow, like the colors as they diminish beyond the subject.', '2004-02-01 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
