(564643, 56454, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better without the knife.  Does not seem to fit.  Still a very nice shot.</td>', 'I think it would have been better without the knife.  Does not seem to fit.  Still a very nice shot.', '2004-02-01 20:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(564652, 56735, 7415, '<td valign="top">is this Chihuli Glass. ?  It is a beautiful photo!</td>', 'is this Chihuli Glass. ?  It is a beautiful photo!', '2004-02-01 20:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(564662, 55938, 1847, '<td valign="top">Probable winner right here.  To be thematically consistent, it mighta been nice to have no light trials underneath the brush, ie, where you haven''t "painted" yet.  But that''s a very small nit.  Nice job.</td>', 'Probable winner right here.  To be thematically consistent, it mighta been nice to have no light trials underneath the brush, ie, where you haven''t "painted" yet.  But that''s a very small nit.  Nice job.', '2004-02-01 20:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(564664, 57022, 1847, '<td valign="top">This is an obscenely difficult shot to pull off, what with all the reflective surfaces.  And your shot does suffer from some distracting reflections.  I like the plan to give the photo an industrialized feel with the brushed steel background, but the bottom of the bowl is a little distracting, too.<br/> <br/>On the upside, you seem to have controlled the reflections off the glass of the bottle really well.</td>', 'This is an obscenely difficult shot to pull off, what with all the reflective surfaces.  And your shot does suffer from some distracting reflections.  I like the plan to give the photo an industrialized feel with the brushed steel background, but the bottom of the bowl is a little distracting, too. On the upside, you seem to have controlled the reflections off the glass of the bottle really well.', '2004-02-01 20:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(564676, 55938, 7711, '<td valign="top">Has to be a ribbon. Unpretentious in its literalism, and the focus is bang on. I love the broken lines of light-- addes interest and the smooth blue tones going to midnight in the corners is wonderful. 10</td>', 'Has to be a ribbon. Unpretentious in its literalism, and the focus is bang on. I love the broken lines of light-- addes interest and the smooth blue tones going to midnight in the corners is wonderful. 10', '2004-02-01 20:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(564683, 57046, 7711, '<td valign="top">elegantly funny. I like the inclusion of the toilet bowl partially. It isn''t so much that it competes with the real star: the almost empty toilet roll.</td>', 'elegantly funny. I like the inclusion of the toilet bowl partially. It isn''t so much that it competes with the real star: the almost empty toilet roll.', '2004-02-01 21:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(564684, 56626, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this without the out of focus reflection. The glass is elegant enough to be interesting all on its own.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this without the out of focus reflection. The glass is elegant enough to be interesting all on its own.', '2004-02-01 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(564685, 57012, 7711, '<td valign="top">i would have cropped this differently..there is too much black space below the apples..they look like they are just floating there, which is odd.</td>', 'i would have cropped this differently..there is too much black space below the apples..they look like they are just floating there, which is odd.', '2004-02-01 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(564696, 56346, 1847, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, though I can''t see how it was "painted with light".  I didn''t mark down because of that, though.  The problem with this shot is two fold.  Most importantly, whatever lighting you applied (flash?  flashlight?) served to do nothing but highlight the snow falling directly in front of you.  It''s kinda distracting.  Second, the composition is a bit off.  I think the trees on the left that are almost incidental in this shot could have been reframed to serve as a lovely "border" for the photo.</td>', 'This is a neat shot, though I can''t see how it was "painted with light".  I didn''t mark down because of that, though.  The problem with this shot is two fold.  Most importantly, whatever lighting you applied (flash?  flashlight?) served to do nothing but highlight the snow falling directly in front of you.  It''s kinda distracting.  Second, the composition is a bit off.  I think the trees on the left that are almost incidental in this shot could have been reframed to serve as a lovely "border" for the photo.', '2004-02-01 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(564730, 56541, 16385, '<td valign="top">it''s nice for background</td>', 'it''s nice for background', '2004-02-01 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(564733, 56791, 7485, '<td valign="top">Striking use of a neon-glow PS filter (or some such filter), but did you "use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand) as the primary method of illumination"?</td>', 'Striking use of a neon-glow PS filter (or some such filter), but did you "use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand) as the primary method of illumination"?', '2004-02-01 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
