(564831, 56288, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, so now I know who made this beautiful glowing photo. This was one of my higher votes. You are really getting better Sally. I am surprised this didn''t place higher.<br/> <br/>The saturation of colour is beautiful. I would have suggested tighter crop for more dynamic composition. The flower kind of flows from the top left to the bottom right, which is very nice. So vertical format would have been probably better choice.<br/> <br/>Still very beautiful photo. You must be very pleased. Way to go!</td>', 'Oh, so now I know who made this beautiful glowing photo. This was one of my higher votes. You are really getting better Sally. I am surprised this didn''t place higher. The saturation of colour is beautiful. I would have suggested tighter crop for more dynamic composition. The flower kind of flows from the top left to the bottom right, which is very nice. So vertical format would have been probably better choice. Still very beautiful photo. You must be very pleased. Way to go!', '2004-02-02 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(564842, 56518, 10275, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot. The detail you show in your photo is mazing. The flower is "full of light". Too bad people didn''t see that. Well done IMO.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot. The detail you show in your photo is mazing. The flower is "full of light". Too bad people didn''t see that. Well done IMO.', '2004-02-02 00:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
