(565137, 56754, 15407, '<td valign="top">The photo is of a very small creature (3mm) much like a brine shrimp which is living in an EcoSphere. The light source was an intense beam from a high powered flashlight shining through a rotating crystal which gave off random prismatic rainbows  this picture depicts one lucky shot of a rainbow illuminating an otherwise translucent body.</td>', 'The photo is of a very small creature (3mm) much like a brine shrimp which is living in an EcoSphere. The light source was an intense beam from a high powered flashlight shining through a rotating crystal which gave off random prismatic rainbows  this picture depicts one lucky shot of a rainbow illuminating an otherwise translucent body.', '2004-02-02 04:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
