(565708, 56933, 772, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 4th place.  This is a nice image.  I just feel that it is outside the spirit of of the rules that govern the member''s challenges.  It is ''legal'' by the wording of the rules.  It is also against the spirit of ''photograph integrity'' as described in the rules.  You used photoshop to add an element to this image that was not part of the original photograph.  There is no ''painting with light'' here so you sorta missed the point of the challenge.  You didn''t learn to effectively use the technique.  :) - Just my opinion, of course...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-02 15:18:41.</i></td>', 'Congrats on 4th place.  This is a nice image.  I just feel that it is outside the spirit of of the rules that govern the member''s challenges.  It is ''legal'' by the wording of the rules.  It is also against the spirit of ''photograph integrity'' as described in the rules.  You used photoshop to add an element to this image that was not part of the original photograph.  There is no ''painting with light'' here so you sorta missed the point of the challenge.  You didn''t learn to effectively use the technique.  :) - Just my opinion, of course...', '2004-02-02 15:11:29.000000', '2004-02-02 15:18:41.000000', 0),
