(567000, 56933, 16239, '<td valign="top">As a new member to DPC ,I am genuinley amazed at the stardard of pictures that are created within the time limits that are set.<br/> Your picture is visually pleasing and works as a ''''piece of art''''.<br/>The none photographic elements appear to upset the ''photograph'' purists and detract from the quality of your work.I cannot go along with that point of view.As amatuer piccy takers we all have kit that we could only dream of 5 or 10 years ago. How we expand the use of our equipment ,continuely pushing boundries mean that there are  no limits on the quality of work that can be produced.<br/>Great work!!</td>', 'As a new member to DPC ,I am genuinley amazed at the stardard of pictures that are created within the time limits that are set. Your picture is visually pleasing and works as a ''''piece of art''''.The none photographic elements appear to upset the ''photograph'' purists and detract from the quality of your work.I cannot go along with that point of view.As amatuer piccy takers we all have kit that we could only dream of 5 or 10 years ago. How we expand the use of our equipment ,continuely pushing boundries mean that there are  no limits on the quality of work that can be produced.Great work!!', '2004-02-03 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 0),
