(629125, 56990, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent vibe and quite skilful to achieve such clarity, exposure and definition with the lasers. I like your profile pic too. I particularly like the dodged edges of the silhouette - very nice.<br/> <br/>I''ve wanted to experiment more with lightplay and light painting but I''ve only managed to explore some easy set-up stuff so far.</td>', 'This is an excellent vibe and quite skilful to achieve such clarity, exposure and definition with the lasers. I like your profile pic too. I particularly like the dodged edges of the silhouette - very nice. I''ve wanted to experiment more with lightplay and light painting but I''ve only managed to explore some easy set-up stuff so far.', '2004-03-19 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
