(1243180, 56933, 17492, '<td valign="top">I hate to be the bearer of bad news, but the laser trail wasn''t even necessary! :) When I first look at this image I thought woah cool! But what''s that red trail?!? What I saw was a miniature bomb stuck inside a martini olive!! Take a bite and go boom! Which would definately fit the James Bond "gadgety" feel of the films. Using the laser for the red glow of the olive would ensure it met the challenge, and eliminate the need for having to edit-in a "laser trail".<br/> <br/>But I digress, this comment comes over a year after the challenge. :)</td>', 'I hate to be the bearer of bad news, but the laser trail wasn''t even necessary! :) When I first look at this image I thought woah cool! But what''s that red trail?!? What I saw was a miniature bomb stuck inside a martini olive!! Take a bite and go boom! Which would definately fit the James Bond "gadgety" feel of the films. Using the laser for the red glow of the olive would ensure it met the challenge, and eliminate the need for having to edit-in a "laser trail". But I digress, this comment comes over a year after the challenge. :)', '2005-03-22 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
