(2018994, 55938, 2553, '<td valign="top">Even after all this time, it''s hard for me NOT to come back to this to look at it.  So simple yet so very compelling to me - the movement of the image combined with the gaussian blur make it a continuing favorite of mine.</td>', 'Even after all this time, it''s hard for me NOT to come back to this to look at it.  So simple yet so very compelling to me - the movement of the image combined with the gaussian blur make it a continuing favorite of mine.', '2006-01-09 16:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
